  "description": "When Eui-Joon sees a vacation ad online, he asks Gun-Woo to go on a road trip. The catch? Eui-Joon wants to drive, but he might be Korea’s worst driver. Under Gun-Woo’s instruction, his skills improve, but Gun-Woo’s college days come up and Eui-Joon can’t help but be a little jealous that he never got to meet the young, innocent Gun-Woo from before he became a gangster. Then, he begins having dreams of the younger Gun-Woo—extremely detailed, realistic dreams—which fuel his obsession. Can Eui-Joon let go of Gun-Woo’s past and embrace the man he loves in the present?\n\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment, edited)",
